<%- include('header') %><h1>Project / hourly estimate defaults</h1><p>Set the proposed hourly rate and minimum for estimates. Every custom estimate requires owner approval. Managed IT and BII prices are unchanged.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/project-pricing"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Default proposed hourly rate<input name="hourly_rate" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="<%= config.hourly_rate??'' %>"></label><label>Minimum estimated hours<input name="minimum_hours" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="<%= config.minimum_hours %>"></label><button>Save estimate defaults</button></form><%- include('footer') %>
